{
  "$comment": "Which codebase-index harnesses a change needs: run-tests.mjs --changed. Paths are relative to the workspace root. A changed file that no glob here covers runs the WHOLE suite; skip lists only other servers and pure docs; none lists, one explicit path each, root files no harness loads. test:test-select fails when a suite script has no entry. Rules: scripts/lib/testSelect.mjs. impactHandler.ts, searchHandler.ts and docSection.ts are left out of @dist on purpose (the dist group lists every other src path one by one, so a NEW src file still falls to the whole suite): each is named only by the harnesses that call a tool it serves — grep the tool names in scripts/test/*.mjs before adding a harness. Hub files (hubs) are left out of @dist the same way: a file most harnesses reach would select the whole suite, so each is named only by the harnesses that assert its own behaviour, with the reason in hubs; test:test-select fails when a hub is in a group, names a harness that does not list it, or is listed by a harness hubs does not name.",
